        GITHUB_ACTIONS["🤖 <b>GitHub Actions CI/CD</b><br/>• Automated Lint (tsc --noEmit)<br/>• Production TypeScript Build<br/>• Docker Build Verification Pipeline"]
        TEST_RUNNER["🧪 <b>Automated Test Suite</b><br/>• Master E2E Runner (npm run test:e2e:all)<br/>• Security, DB, Auth, Cache, Admin suites"]
    end

    %% Connections
    M_NET -->|REST HTTPS / WSS| B_RUNTIME
    W_NET -->|REST HTTPS / WSS| B_RUNTIME
