    B_RUNTIME -->|OTP Email Delivery| EMAIL_SMTP
    B_RUNTIME -->|Token Verify| AUTH_GOOGLE

    B_RUNTIME <-->|Get / Set / Invalidate Cache| REDIS
    B_RUNTIME <-->|CRUD, Text Search & Aggregations| MONGO

    DEVOPS_LAYER -.->|Build & Deploy| CLIENT_LAYER
    DEVOPS_LAYER -.->|Orchestrate & Monitor| BACKEND_LAYER
